# B03 — index boundary (TYPE-003). A FASTA reference produced WITHOUT a .fai
# feeds a consumer that requires index=fai (samtools faidx / GATK -R). Builds
# agree (both GRCh38), so the ONLY violation is the missing companion index.
# Derivation: workflow-format reference (index field) + TYPE-003 row.
#
# EXPECTED: reject — TYPE-003.

[workflow]
name = "b03"

[[rules]]
name = "download_ref"
output = ["ref.fa"]
shell = "curl -o ref.fa https://example.org/GRCh38.fa"
[rules.types]
outputs = { default = "FASTA[reference_build=GRCh38]" }

[[rules]]
name = "call"
input = ["ref.fa"]
output = ["out.vcf"]
shell = "gatk HaplotypeCaller -R ref.fa -I a.bam -O out.vcf"
[rules.types]
inputs = { default = "FASTA[reference_build=GRCh38,index=fai]" }
